'''Onan's Streak''' is [[Challenges|challenge]] #29. {{C|Judas}} starts with {{I|The Book of Belial}}, {{I|Chocolate Milk}}, and a [[damage]] bonus of +2, giving him a starting damage of 8.71. However, missing a shot causes Judas to take damage. Treasure rooms are present in this challenge. The goal is to defeat {{E|Isaac}}.

== Difficulty ==
Not hitting anything with tears causes Judas to take damage. This makes accuracy very important, as missing a few shots can deplete his health very quickly. Because of this, fast-moving enemies or enemies with erratic movement patterns can prove to be very difficult in this challenge.

