== Trivia ==
* The challenge's name, "Onan's Streak", and the challenge conditions are a reference to the biblical character [[wikipedia:Onan|Onan]], the son of Judah. According to Old Testament law, a man with a married, deceased brother would have the responsibility of producing an heir for his sibling. Onan knew that having this heir would prevent him from legally owning his brother's land, and so spilled his semen onto the ground. God viewed this deed as wicked and killed Onan.
* {{dlc|nr}} Despite the challenge starring {{C|Judas}}, the challenge is only unlocked when beating {{E|Mom}}.

